        "faq_head": "Got Questions About Somna?",
        "faq_sub": "Get quick answers to the most common questions, from how it works to shipping and returns.",
        "faq_q1": "Is Somna right for sleep apnea?",
        "faq_a1": "<p>Somna products are designed to support better sleep, breathing, and wake-ups. They are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent sleep apnea. If you have been diagnosed with sleep apnea or suspect you may have it, consult a healthcare professional for proper evaluation and treatment.</p>",
        "faq_q2": "How does the Silent Alarm Band work?",
