        "faq_q5": "How long does shipping take?",
        "faq_a5": "<p>Orders are typically processed within 1-2 business days. Most customers receive their order within 3-7 business days depending on location. You'll receive tracking information as soon as your order ships.</p>",
        "faq_q6": "Are the Nasal Strips reusable?",
        "faq_a6": "<p>No. For the best performance and hygiene, Somna Nasal Strips are designed for single-use and should be replaced daily.</p>",
        "faq_q7": "Can I use Mouth Tape and Nasal Strips together?",
        "faq_a7": "<p>Yes. Many customers combine both products as part of their nightly routine to support comfortable nasal breathing and a better sleep experience.</p>",
        "faq_q8": "How long does the Alarm Band battery last?",
        "faq_a8": "<p>The Silent Alarm Band is rechargeable and provides multiple nights of use on a single charge, depending on vibration settings and usage patterns.</p>",
        "faq_q9": "Can I cancel my subscription anytime?",
        "faq_a9": "<p>Absolutely. There are no contracts or commitments. You can pause, skip, modify, or cancel your subscription at any time.</p>",
